# the same program with the calls of built-ins withheld: no layout has a serializer, so an object that may lie in itself is not written whole, and nobody begins a text that he cannot end
# RUN: json-plan mechanisms=-BuiltinCalls
# CHECK: object L0
# RUN(NEVER): json-plan mechanisms=-BuiltinCalls
# NEVER-NOT: whole
# PROGRAM-OF: object-that-lies-in-itself-is-written-by-its-serializer.ir
